Pawpad is a modified version of Recall, which plays Overwatch on Apple Silicon Macs.
It runs Aniimo instead: its own setup worker (pawpad/Worker), app (pawpad/App) and build
script (scripts/build_pawpad.py), Wine patch patches/wine-rsaenh-hmac.patch, and small
changes to Recall's shared worker code (scripts/portable_network.h).

